WEBVTT

00:14:00.043 --> 00:14:03.547
And this project opened
at the end of last year,

00:14:03.547 --> 00:14:04.923
the first half of it.

00:14:05.549 --> 00:14:09.303
And we have 100,000
people going to it every day.

00:14:09.303 --> 00:14:13.682
And it wasn't just about trees and plants,

00:14:13.682 --> 00:14:16.977
but even structural columns
were our friends

00:14:16.977 --> 00:14:19.897
to humanize the project at such a scale.

00:14:20.397 --> 00:14:22.900
So I'm not saying

00:14:22.941 --> 00:14:27.154
that there's any one language or approach

00:14:27.195 --> 00:14:30.407
to deal with this epidemic of boring.